        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Interface\n\nFive lessons on using the app with confidence. Left to right and top to bottom is the order to read them.\n\n**Look.** The browser bar and the graph surface.\n\n**Work.** Panels and menus, and the editing flow.\n\n**Trust.** Save, refresh and trust.\n\nThis graph is a collection. Each tile is a portal it contains, and what a tile shows (its name, its description, how many pieces it has) is read from the graph behind it, so nothing here is a copy."
        },
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "manually-shaped",
